{"asset_key":"ep4/quest_story_14102410","episode":"ep4","category":"quest_story","story_id":"14102410","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:1:1410241001:1":{"text":"Helthor's beard! How did you fall from above?!","source_cn":"赫托在下！你们怎么会从上面掉下来？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA38B4E2702C374BD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:2:1410241001":{"text":"Helthor's beard! How did you fall from above?!","source_cn":"赫托在下！你们怎么会从上面掉下来？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA38B4E2702C374BD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1410241002:1":{"text":"Oh, right. I've been underground for so long that I nearly forgot most surface folk only know Dura now.","source_cn":"噢……不好意思，我在地底下住了太久，差点忘了如今上边大...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE587AA12C75EA618","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1410241003:1":{"text":"Helthor is the <style=\"highlight\">God of Mining and Metallurgy</style>! Our great dwarven father!","source_cn":"赫托，那是<style=highlight>采矿与冶金...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3684E623B6A5FC6E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1410241004:1":{"text":"He taught us to mine and passed down the art of forging... but that was ages ago, and he's long—","source_cn":"他教会我们开采矿石，传授给我们锻造的技艺。不过那都是很...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x911E0AAA25E4D17F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1410241005:2":{"text":"Wait, wait! No time for history lessons! You ruined my 3,672nd detonation experiment!","source_cn":"不对不对……现在没空说这些！都怪你们，第三千六百七十二...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x40C40BEC7D4B6386","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:7:1410241005":{"text":"Wait, wait! No time for history lessons! You ruined my 3,672nd detonation experiment!","source_cn":"不对不对……现在没空说这些！都怪你们，第三千六百七十二次起爆实验又失败了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x40C40BEC7D4B6386","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1410241006:1":{"text":"Ugh, don't look at me like I'm some villain.","source_cn":"你那是什么眼神……像是在看大坏蛋。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xB336BB36D6B564F7","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Ugh, don't look at me like I'm some villain.","female":"Ugh, don't look at me like I'm some villain.","variant_male_record_index":"156362","variant_female_record_index":"156363","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1410241007:1":{"text":"Explosives? That explains the sharp, acrid smell. It was strong gunpowder!","source_cn":"起爆实验……你难道在制造炸弹？难怪我刚刚闻到了刺鼻的味...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2090A312B22BD6CC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1410241008:1":{"text":"So what? I conduct my research underground. I'm not hurting anyone.","source_cn":"那又怎么样，我在地底下研究炸药没影响任何人吧？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDBD2D39B4C7F9C1A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1410241009:2":{"text":"We were blown down here because of you!","source_cn":"我们不就被你给轰下来了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x54856FA84377D94B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1410241010:1":{"text":"And you crashed into my experiment, little mouse. Let's call it even.","source_cn":"小耗子，我还没怪你们砸坏了我的研究器材。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x042493C39E58635D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:15:1410241010":{"text":"And you crashed into my experiment, little mouse. Let's call it even.","source_cn":"小耗子，我还没怪你们砸坏了我的研究器材。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x042493C39E58635D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1410241011:1":{"text":"No, no, you first! Who are YOU?","source_cn":"你这个人，明明是我先问的！你们先回答我的问题！","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x23C9500663729779","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"No, no, you first! Who are YOU?","female":"No, no, you first! Who are YOU?","variant_male_record_index":"156368","variant_female_record_index":"156369","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1410241012:1":{"text":"How'd you end up in my lab? Are you here to steal my research?!","source_cn":"你们是谁？怎么会出现在我的研究所上面？难道是想剽窃我的...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4F40954D117D01C2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:18:1410241012":{"text":"How'd you end up in my lab? Are you here to steal my research?!","source_cn":"你们是谁？怎么会出现在我的研究所上面？难道是想剽窃我的灵感创意？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4F40954D117D01C2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1410241013:1":{"text":"This is my domain! Don't act like I'm the suspicious one!","source_cn":"不是……我为什么非要告诉你？这里可是我的地盘，别对我凶...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x12E64688CE540FB7","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"This is my domain! Don't act like I'm the suspicious one!","female":"This is my domain! Don't act like I'm the suspicious one!","variant_male_record_index":"156371","variant_female_record_index":"156372","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1410241014:1":{"text":"Magister, this girl seems awfully shady...","source_cn":"主人……这位矮人小姑娘很可疑。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xFDCCBFABB5A79C47","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Magister, this girl seems awfully shady...","female":"Magister, this girl seems awfully shady...","variant_male_record_index":"156373","variant_female_record_index":"156374","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1410241015:1":{"text":"Yeah, what's your game down here? Spill it!","source_cn":"矮人小姑娘，你们在地下鬼鬼祟祟地搞什么？从实招来！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAED65DB3A776B707","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1410241016:1":{"text":"Hey, wait!","source_cn":"等、等等——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x65296E3C7E9847F3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:24:1410241017:1":{"text":"We won't go easy on you just because you're small! Chippy, prepare for battle!","source_cn":"我们不会因为你是小孩子就手下留情，满满！拿起武器！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC3B9DE421998B6B1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:25:1410241018:1":{"text":"Ready!","source_cn":"明白！<key:dialog41>","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC176DEE4B86F52ED","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:26:1410241019:1":{"text":"Whoa! Put those away! There's delicate equipment here!","source_cn":"别！先把武器收起来！我这里可都是研究设备！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD7